# Capacitor's native projects (packages/mobile). After `cap sync` both trees
# hold a full copy of the built web bundle (ios/App/App/public and
# android/app/src/main/assets/public), which `pnpm fmt:fix` would otherwise
# walk and rewrite; the rest is generated Xcode and Gradle output.
packages/mobile/ios
packages/mobile/android

# docs/agent/BUGS.md: hand-edited, and its body is quoted evidence —
# code, log lines and shell fragments — not prose. Prettier parses the `*` and
# `_` in that quoted text as markdown emphasis and rewrites them, turning
# `pull_request` into `pull*request` and `User-agent: *` into `User-agent: _`.
# The damage is silent and not idempotent, so the file is excluded rather than
# formatted. docs/agent/INDEX.md is NOT listed here: its generator formats its
# own output with this repo's prettier config, so it stays stable.
docs/agent/BUGS.md
